. Wild, rebellious, selfish. I strained against responsibility. The shadow of my sire and his amici eclipsed me, when I wished to shine in the dark. Now they're all fine ash or bad memories. Liars, traitors, cow\u0002ards. I take up the sword of duty of my own will and the shad\u0002ows I cast are long, deep, and dead.&quot;<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3523-spencer-from-the-hills","name":"Spencer from The Hills","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"546"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-21T22:23:53-07:00","id":1481642,"title":"","content":"Relaxing getting some me time in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-22T17:57:18-07:00","id":1481702,"title":"","content":"Lucita is totally rooting for the Dallas Mavs over those pikers, the Golden State Losers.<br /> <br /> Edit: She might be in the same bar as I am. Yes I have been drinking, why do you ask?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1208,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","user":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","date":". 05-22-2022, 09:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-23T07:43:11-07:00","id":1481753,"title":"","content":"Didnt talley destroy her? So probably entertaining the worms","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24527-blackshade","name":"blackshade","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"224"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-24T14:50:52-07:00","id":1481863,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>blackshade</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1481602-what-do-you-think-lucita-is-doing-now?p=1481753#post1481753\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Didnt talley destroy her? So probably entertaining the worms</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That's what it says in his write up in Chicago By Night. But there is hints that she is still around and kicking. <br /> <br /> It could be any of the following.<br /> <br /> 1: Talley and Lucitia are both elders who predate the sects and they may have made some sort of deal that aid both of there interests. It's possible but I don't rate it as the most likely.<br /> <br /> 2: Talley and Lucitia did fight and thinks he put her down and for some reason didn't check to make sure and made a assumption. I don't go with that notion either. Talley wouldn't be that sloppy and he hunts lupines.<br /> <br /> 3: Talley thinks he did take out Lucita. But surprise it wasn't her! It was a double of her made to believe that she was the genuine article. Somewhat improbable. But we are playing a game fiilled with vampires that defy the odds. I find it more likely then the first two options.<br /> <br /> 4: Talley did put his clan mate to final death and another Lasombra of comparable age and power has taken up the mantle for her own purposes. This is a very likely scenario and has been done before.<br /> <br /> 5: Talley has been dominated into thinking it happened and there was no fight at all. Who would make the effort I can't say as her sire and grandsire are gone. <br /> <br /> That is my two cents.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-25T01:08:35-07:00","id":1481904,"title":"","content":"Lucita maybe pulled a Marcus Vitel and fled into the Abyss, leaving a simulacrum of blood and shadow that was destroyed by Talley <br /> After her &quot;return&quot; and taking over the Sect in Madrid Talley is probably on the run to escape her wrath... after all he &quot;fled&quot; in to the Camarilla with the rest of the Clan, safest from Her at the moment","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23890-shadeprowler","name":"Shadeprowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2